---
import HomeTemplate from '../components/templates/HomeTemplate.astro';
---

<HomeTemplate
  title="RPG Maker Save Editor Online — Free Browser MV & MZ Editor"
  description="Free online RPG Maker save editor for MZ .rmmzsave and MV .rpgsave files. Edit gold locally in your browser with automatic backup zip. No download or server upload."
  keywords="rpg maker save editor, rpg maker save editor online, rpg maker mv save editor, rpg maker mz save editor, rmmzsave editor, rpgsave editor"
>
  <div slot="seo-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto prose prose-blue prose-lg dark:prose-invert text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">
      Browser-Based RPG Maker Save Editor
    </h2>
    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>SaveFileTool</strong>, a free online <strong>RPG Maker save editor</strong>
      built for compatible <a href="/editor/rpg-maker-mz/">RPG Maker MZ (<code>.rmmzsave</code>)</a>
      and <a href="/editor/rpg-maker-mv/">RPG Maker MV (<code>.rpgsave</code>)</a> save files, with
      backup-first guidance and automatic original-file archiving before you replace any slot.
    </p>

    <figure class="my-8 not-prose overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
      <img
        src="/images/savefiletool-editor.png"
        alt="SaveFileTool RPG Maker save editor interface showing verified gold editing in the browser"
        class="w-full h-auto block"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption class="border-t border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm text-gray-600 dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800/90 dark:text-gray-300">
        SaveFileTool editor preview: inspect detected currency and candidate fields locally, then export a zip with your original backup included.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8 not-prose">
      <a
        href="/editor/rpg-maker-mz/"
        class="group block rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-primary-400 hover:shadow-md dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400">RPG Maker MZ Save Editor</h3>
          <span class="rounded bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-950/60 dark:text-blue-300">.rmmzsave</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">
          Edit desktop MZ numbered save slots (<code>file1.rmmzsave</code>) locally with a real-game verified currency workflow.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 group-hover:underline">Open MZ Editor &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/editor/rpg-maker-mv/"
        class="group block rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-primary-400 hover:shadow-md dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400">RPG Maker MV Save Editor</h3>
          <span class="rounded bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 dark:text-emerald-300">.rpgsave</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">
          Edit desktop MV save files (<code>file1.rpgsave</code>) with gold editing verified in an official MV 1.6.1 trial project.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 group-hover:underline">Open MV Editor &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-8 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Why Use a Local Browser Editor?</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>No suspicious .exe downloads — runs locally like an offline RPG Maker save editor once loaded</li>
          <li>Works on Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android browsers</li>
          <li>Every download bundles your edited save plus an unchanged original backup</li>
          <li>Zero server upload, no login, and no third-party ad or tracking scripts</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Published Scope &amp; Roadmap</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li><strong>Published editors</strong>: RPG Maker MZ (<code>.rmmzsave</code>) and MV (<code>.rpgsave</code>)</li>
          <li><strong>Verified gold edits</strong>: MZ real-save workflow and MV official trial project</li>
          <li><strong>Candidate fields</strong>: actor stats, inventory, variables, and switches require in-game verification</li>
          <li><strong>Older formats</strong>: RPG Maker XP (<code>.rxdata</code>) and VX Ace (<code>.rvdata2</code>) are not yet published — <a href="/support/" class="text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline">request support</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>
      Unlike desktop tools that require unknown binaries, <strong>SaveFileTool</strong> is
      <a href="https://github.com/bikai9289/savefiletool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open source on GitHub</a>
      and keeps the entire editing flow inside your browser. Have a question about locating save folders or troubleshooting a custom plugin?
      Check the <a href="/faq/">RPG Maker Save Editor FAQ</a> or <a href="/support/">Support guide</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</HomeTemplate>
